# Design System — Issue + Participation

**North star screenshots:** Finimize home feed, article detail, and onboarding CTA  
(content-first editorial, one royal blue accent, calm whitespace, soft elevation).

Product mapping: Finimize *article card* → our **Issue card**; Finimize *play/bookmark* → our **participate (vote)**; Finimize *membership bar* → rare inverse CTA only.

Not: brokerage terminal, Toss gray-inset lists, teal legacy chrome, social graph, news dump.

---

## Hard rules

1. **North star = Finimize** — not Toss inset chrome, not Bloomberg density.
2. Prefer **remove UI** over adding density when unsure.
3. **One primary action per Issue:** participate (vote) when suitable. Everything else is secondary.
4. **One brand accent** (`#2D5BE3`). Status colors (rising / up-down) are signals, not chrome.
5. Do not force vote UI when `participation_suitable` is false — read-only Issue.
6. Evidence / sources stay on Detail — never replace trust with “🔥 TRENDING” alone.
7. **Adopt Finimize hierarchy; adapt Finimize chrome** — we do not ship Weekly Brief hero, Ideas/Discover/AI tabs, or membership unlock bar in MVP.

---

## What we adopt vs skip (from benchmarks)

| Finimize pattern | Our product |
|------------------|-------------|
| Bold headline → muted dek → footer category | **Adopt** as Issue card spine |
| Soft white elevated spotlight cards | **Adopt** for featured Issue / key prompts |
| Pill CTA + hard black offset shadow | **Adopt** for decisive single actions only |
| ALL-CAPS blue category (NEWS / QUICK TAKE) | **Adopt** → 이슈 / 의견 / 뉴스 등 |
| Meta: name · time · read | **Adapt** → 출처/카테고리 · 시간 · N명 참여 |
| Large hero image under headline | **Optional** — graceful without image |
| Compact row: text + right thumbnail | **Optional** for 급상승 strip |
| 🔥 TRENDING top-right | **Optional** on rising only — never sole trust cue |
| Greeting “Afternoon, Name” | **Optional** later; MVP may use “오늘의 이슈” |
| Weekly Brief / asset BUY cards | **Skip** (deferred finance) |
| Sticky black membership bar | **Skip** unless paywall exists |
| 4-tab Home/Ideas/Discover/AI | **Skip** → `홈 \| 내 이슈 \| 프로필` (설정은 프로필 기어) |

