## Color (locked)

| Token | Value | Use |
|-------|--------|-----|
| Background | `#FFFFFF` | Screen canvas, feed |
| Canvas soft | `#F7F8FA` | Rare soft host (vote panel bg) — not default feed chrome |
| Surface | `#FFFFFF` | Elevated cards, sheets |
| Foreground | `#0A0A0A` | Titles, primary text |
| Muted | `#4B5563` | Dek/summary, timestamps, secondary meta |
| Border / hairline | `rgba(0,0,0,0.08)` | Inputs, subtle dividers |
| Accent | `#2D5BE3` | Active tab, category labels, links, primary CTA fill |
| Accent soft | `#E8EEFC` | Selected vote fill, soft chips |
| CTA inverse | `#0A0A0A` | Rare full-width promo bar (white text) |
| Rising hint | `#E85D04` | “급상승” / TRENDING label only |

Avoid: purple glow, **teal brand** (`#0C7A73`), loud gradients, multi-accent rainbow, green “BUY” finance chrome on Issue cards.

