## Typography

### Font stack

```text
"Pretendard", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Noto Sans KR", system-ui, sans-serif
```

### Scale (mobile) — Finimize-weighted

| Role | Size | Weight | Color | Notes |
|------|------|--------|-------|--------|
| Screen / greeting title | 26–30px | Bold–ExtraBold (700–800) | Foreground | Home left; tracking ≈ -0.02em |
| Issue headline (feed) | **22–26px** | Bold (700) | Foreground | 2–3 lines; dominant scan target |
| Issue headline (detail) | **28–32px** | ExtraBold (800) | Foreground | Editorial lead |
| Section title | 17–18px | SemiBold (600) | Foreground | “지금 뜨는 이슈” |
| Dek / summary | 15–16px | Regular (400) | Muted | 2–3 lines feed; fuller on detail |
| Body (detail) | 16–17px | Regular (400) | Foreground | line-height ≈ 1.55–1.65 |
| Question | 16–17px | SemiBold (600) | Foreground | “당신의 생각은?” |
| Meta | 12–13px | Regular (400) | Muted | middot separators |
| Category label | 11–12px | Bold (700) | Accent | **ALL CAPS** (or KO equivalent weight); tracking ≈ 0.06em; **text only — no pill fill** |
| Tab label | 10–11px | Medium | Muted / Accent when active | |

Hierarchy rule: **headline wins**. Summary never competes with title weight.

---

## Layout & spacing

- Mobile-first, content width ~430px centered.
- Horizontal padding: **20px**.
- Between feed Issues: **28–36px whitespace** (Finimize gap) — prefer gap over dense hairline stacks.
- Section gap: **28–40px**.
- Tap targets ≥ 44px.
- Home weight: **Issue feed first**. No Brief hero, no ticker, no watchlist strip.

---

## Elevation & surfaces

Finimize uses **two surface modes** — do not collapse into one.

### A. Feed default (editorial stack)

- White canvas
- Issues separated by **generous whitespace** (not Toss gray inset lists)
- No heavy border around every item
- Optional hairline only if gap alone is unclear

### B. Soft elevated card (spotlight)

Use for: first/featured Issue, onboarding prompts, rare callouts.

- Surface `#FFFFFF`
- Radius **14–16px**
- Shadow: `0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)` — soft, not neo-brutal
- Padding ~16–18px

### C. Vote / participation panel

- Optional Canvas soft `#F7F8FA` host **on Detail only**
- Not used as default feed chrome

---

## Issue card anatomy (Finimize-aligned)

### Featured / standard feed card

```text
[Meta row — source or “이슈” · time · N명 참여]
[Headline — bold 22–26px]
[Summary — muted, 2–3 lines]
[Optional hero image — 16:9 / 4:3, radius 12–14px]
[Optional key points — ≤3, feed only if short]
──────────────── footer
[CATEGORY — Accent ALL-CAPS left]     [생각 남기기 →  or option chips]
```

### Compact card (급상승 / secondary)

```text
[Meta · optional 급상승 right]
[Headline + summary — left ⅔]
[Optional thumb — right ⅓, radius 10–12px]
[CATEGORY footer]
```

### Rules

- **Category lives in the footer** (Finimize NEWS / QUICK TAKE), not as a loud top chip with fill.
- Meta uses middots: `시간 · N명 참여`.
- Left-aligned scan path.
- No price columns, % pills, BUY/SELL dots on Issue cards.
- When `participation_suitable`: show question + chips or “생각 남기기 →” as the card’s action.
- When not suitable: omit vote chrome; footer can be category + “자세히”.
- Press: light opacity (`.pressable`) — no bounce.

---

## Issue Detail (Finimize article order)

Do not rearrange without product reason:

1. Utility bar — back (left); optional share (right). No dense icon rows.
2. **Title** (28–32px ExtraBold)
3. **Dek / summary** (muted)
4. Meta — time · source count (Accent link style for tappable source names if any)
5. Optional hero image
6. Why it matters (short) + key points
7. Sources (compact)
8. **Participation block** (question + full-width options + %) — primary action
9. Comments

Participation block:

- Full-width options, min-height **52px**, radius **12px**
- Default: white + Accent outline
- Selected: Accent soft fill + Accent border
- Show % / counts after vote (or live if product prefers transparency)
- Omit entirely if not `participation_suitable`

---

## Buttons & inputs

### Primary decisive CTA (onboarding / single commit)

From Finimize “That’s me!”:

- Pill (`border-radius: 9999px`)
- Fill Accent `#2D5BE3`, text white, SemiBold
- Hard offset shadow: **`3px 3px 0 #0A0A0A`** (solid, not blur)
- Use for: onboarding continue, rare one-shot commits
- **Do not** put offset shadow on every vote row or every feed chip

### Vote options

- Rounded rect 12px, Accent outline; selected = Accent soft
- No offset shadow

### Secondary

- Accent text SemiBold / ALL-CAPS category — no pill storms

### Inputs

- Radius **8–10px**, hairline border, generous padding (~14–16px)
- Focus: thin Accent caret/ring — not neon glow
- One field per screen when possible (onboarding pattern)

---

## Headers & navigation

### Home header

Prefer Finimize calm greeting energy:

- Large left title (“오늘의 이슈” or later `안녕하세요, {name}`)
- Optional one-line muted subtitle
- Optional outline profile affordance top-right (settings shortcut) — keep sparse
- No ticker, no Brief listen bar

### Bottom tabs (MVP)

```text
홈 | 내 이슈 | 프로필
```

- White bar, hairline top
- Active = Accent fill/stroke; inactive = muted outline
- Settings lives under Profile (top-right gear), not as a tab
- Hide finance tabs (관심 / 일정) and audio Brief from primary chrome

---

## Imagery (optional)

- Prefer real editorial / context photos when we have them
- Radius **12–14px** (featured), **10–12px** (thumb)
- Aspect: featured ~4:3 or 16:9; thumb square/4:3
- **No image required** — typography hierarchy must stand alone (MVP default)

---

## Prefer / avoid

**Prefer**

- Typography + whitespace as hierarchy (Finimize feed)
- Category as Accent **text label** in footer
- Soft elevation only for spotlight
- Offset-shadow pill only for decisive CTAs
- Read → one-tap participate → see results

**Avoid**

- Teal legacy chrome
- Toss gray inset list shells as default feed
- Pill filter clusters / chip storms
- Bloomberg density / chart walls
- Purple AI glow
- Emoji as the only structure (🔥 OK only as rising hint)
- Forced 찬성/반대 on non-debatable Issues
- Copying Finimize Brief / membership / 4-tab IA into MVP

---

## Motion

Calm, short. Hierarchy — not decoration. No bounce loops on Home.

---

## Implementation checklist (UI PRs)

1. Accent `#2D5BE3` — zero teal brand chrome
2. Feed = white + **generous gaps**; soft elevate only featured
3. Card order: **meta → headline → summary → (image) → footer category + action**
4. Headlines **22–26 feed / 28–32 detail**; summaries Muted
5. Category = Accent ALL-CAPS text, **no filled pill**
6. Vote = primary action; sources secondary on Detail
7. Decisive CTA may use `3px 3px 0 #0A0A0A` offset; vote rows do not
8. Readable for middle-aged users — large type, few actions
